    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "id": "86624229",
      "metadata": {
        "id": "86624229"
      },
      "source": [
        "## Selección de Mejores Variables predictoras"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "id": "84ec747e",
      "metadata": {
        "id": "84ec747e"
      },
      "source": [
        "Construcción de listados para preprocesamiento:\n",
        "- Se utilizó el coeficiente de correlación de Pearson para medir la fuerza y dirección de la relación entre las distintas variables (cuantitativas y cualitativas codificadas) y la variable objetivo (tenure), seleccionando así los predictores con mayor o moderado impacto para el modelo."
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "code",
      "execution_count": 217,
      "id": "8f9d579a",
      "metadata": {
        "id": "8f9d579a"
      },
      "outputs": [],
      "source": [
        "numericas = ['TotalCharges','MonthlyCharges']\n",
        "categoricas_binarias = ['Partner','DeviceProtection','OnlineSecurity', 'OnlineBackup','Dependents','TechSupport','StreamingTV','StreamingMovies']\n",
        "categoricas_nominales = [\n",
        "    \"InternetService\", # categorías: 'DSL', 'Fiber optic', 'No'\n",
        "    \"PaymentMethod\" # Categorías: 'Bank transfer (automatic)', 'Credit card (automatic)', 'Electronic check', 'Mailed check'\n",
        "]\n",
        "categoricas_ordinales = [\n",
        "    'Contract' #Categorías: 'Month-to-month', 'One year', 'Two year'\n",
        "]\n",
        "jerarquia_contrato = [['Month-to-month', 'One year', 'Two year']]"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "id": "8370de7c",
      "metadata": {
        "id": "8370de7c"
      },
      "source": [
        "# Limpieza y Transformación de Datos"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "code",
      "execution_count": 218,
      "id": "862da0d8",
      "metadata": {
        "id": "862da0d8"
      },
      "outputs": [],
      "source": [
        "pipeline_numerico = Pipeline([\n",
        "    (\"winsorizer\", Winsorizer(capping_method='quantiles', tail='both', fold=0.05)),\n",
        "    (\"imputer\", SimpleImputer(strategy=\"mean\")),\n",
        "    ('scaler', MinMaxScaler())\n",
        "])\n",
        "\n",
        "pipeline_categorico_nominal = Pipeline([\n",
        "    (\"imputer\", SimpleImputer(strategy=\"most_frequent\")),\n",
        "    (\"encoder\", OneHotEncoder(\n",
        "        handle_unknown=\"ignore\",\n",
        "        sparse_output=False)\n",
        "    )\n",
        "])\n",
        "\n",
        "pipeline_categorico_binario = Pipeline([\n",
        "    (\"imputer\", SimpleImputer(strategy=\"most_frequent\")),\n",
        "    (\"encoder\", OrdinalEncoder(handle_unknown='use_encoded_value', unknown_value=-1))\n",
        "])\n",
        "\n",
        "pipeline_categorico_ordinal = Pipeline([\n",
        "    (\"imputer\", SimpleImputer(strategy=\"most_frequent\")),\n",
        "    (\"encoder\", OrdinalEncoder(categories=jerarquia_contrato, handle_unknown='use_encoded_value', unknown_value=-1))\n",
        "])\n",
        "\n",
        "pipeline_preprocessor = ColumnTransformer(\n",
        "    transformers=[\n",
        "        (\"num\", pipeline_numerico, numericas),\n",
        "        (\"cat_nom\", pipeline_categorico_nominal, categoricas_nominales),\n",
        "        (\"cat_bin\", pipeline_categorico_binario, categoricas_binarias),\n",
        "        (\"cat_ord\", pipeline_categorico_ordinal, categoricas_ordinales)\n",
        "    ],\n",
        "    remainder = \"drop\"\n",
        ")"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "id": "4rQ-hVCiX-9Y",
      "metadata": {
        "id": "4rQ-hVCiX-9Y"
      },
      "source": [
        "## Modelo de Regresión Lineal\n",
        "Variable Objetivo: Tenure"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "id": "B7PFHim-8Ocx",
      "metadata": {
        "id": "B7PFHim-8Ocx"
      },
      "source": [
        "### Pipeline de regresión lineal"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "code",
      "execution_count": 219,
      "id": "K2aqqrNaXk8Z",
      "metadata": {
        "id": "K2aqqrNaXk8Z"
      },
      "outputs": [],
      "source": [
        "pipeline_final_lr = Pipeline(steps=[\n",
        "    ('preprocesador', pipeline_preprocessor),\n",
        "    ('modelo', LinearRegression(\n",
        "\n",
        "    ))\n",
        "])"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "id": "9idLN9YfNgyK",
      "metadata": {
        "id": "9idLN9YfNgyK"
      },
      "source": [
        "- Se utilizó el algoritmo de **Regresión Lineal** (LinearRegression) debido a su capacidad para modelar la relación entre las variables explicativas (X) y la variable objetivo (Y), trazando la linea que mejor se ajusta a los datos para predecir su comportamiento de forma directa e interpretable."
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "id": "ZTywrBXz9Z6A",
      "metadata": {
        "id": "ZTywrBXz9Z6A"
      },
      "source": [
        "### División de los datos"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "code",
      "execution_count": 220,
      "id": "Q9o40o968mWp",
      "metadata": {
        "id": "Q9o40o968mWp"
      },
      "outputs": [],
      "source": [
        "X = df.drop(columns=['tenure', \"customerID_Hash\"])\n",
        "\n",
        "y = df['tenure']\n",
        "\n",
        "X_train, X_test, y_train, y_test = train_test_split(\n",
        "    X,\n",
        "    y,\n",
        "    test_size=0.20,\n",
        "    random_state=42\n",
        ")"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "id": "-94zs6yq9qQb",
      "metadata": {
        "id": "-94zs6yq9qQb"
      },
      "source": [
        "### Entrenamiento y Evaluación RL"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "code",
      "execution_count": 221,
      "id": "lA_utXHQ9Nu6",
      "metadata": {
        "id": "lA_utXHQ9Nu6"
      },
      "outputs": [],
      "source": [
        "pipeline_final_lr.fit(X_train, y_train)\n",
        "y_pred = pipeline_final_lr.predict(X_test)"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "id": "khJjuqPsA5ns",
      "metadata": {
        "id": "khJjuqPsA5ns"
      },
      "source": [
        "### Visualizar métricas"
      ]
    },
    {
